        "original_id": "b3c89f2d-a39b-5091-9361-b5a1dbaf8316",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Marie Fredriksson, Bada, Per Gessle\n- Music works: I en tid som vår, Made In Sea\n- Roles: singer-songwriters, pianist, musical actress\n- Groups: Roxette\n\nFacts:\n- Marie Fredriksson was born on 30 May 1958 and was a Swedish pop singer-songwriter and pianist.\n- Bada, whose real name is Choi Sung-hee, was born on February 28, 1980 and is a South Korean singer and musical actress.\n- Marie Fredriksson and Per Gessle created the pop rock duo Roxette in 1986.\n- I en tid som vår is the fifth album by Swedish pop singer-songwriter Marie Fredriksson.\n- Made In Sea is the third album by South Korean singer Bada and was released on January 26, 2006.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
